text.paragraph:
Monitor patients concomitantly receiving moderate CYP3A4 inhibitors (e.g., fluconazole) for increased adverse reactions and consider VONJO dose modifications based on safety  [see Dosage and Administration (
                                 2.5
                                 )]. Concomitant use of VONJO with doses of fluconazole greater than 200 mg once daily has not been studied.
